{"scenario": "work/mirror-traffic-at-30-agents", "requires": ["v1", "test-hooks"], "pending": "the burst of 30 agents sends 44 agent snapshots in one go, over the budget row's 30 per second: the hub has no snapshot coalescing across sessions (the manager decides whether the budget or the hub changes)", "doc": "Budget row work-mirror-traffic (design 13): 30 agents each finish a turn that writes 1 MB, while an editor is subscribed to the hub's events and a second one also to the entries of one session. In 1 s the first gets at most 30 agent snapshots and no agent-entries; the second gets entries of its one session only; no line to either holds rawInput."}
